## Why This Is Asked
Tests temporal reasoning with 3-valued Kleene logic and practical propagation.

## Key Concepts
- Temporal Kleene semantics with t+1 constraints
- Propagation and pruning to avoid F outcomes
- Concrete trace construction for feasibility validation

## Code Example
```javascript
function kleeneNot(v){
  if(v==='T') return 'F';
  if(v==='F') return 'T';
  return 'U';
}
function kleeneOr(a,b){
  const order={F:0, U:1, T:2};
  return order[a] >= order[b] ? a : b;
}
function implies(a,b){
  // a -> b = (¬a) ∨ b
  return kleeneOr(kleeneNot(a), b);
}
